{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21365","headline":"泛江翫月十二韵 · 元稹","name":"泛江翫月十二韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚塞分形势，羊公压大邦。\n因依多士子，参画尽敦厖。\n岳璧闲相对，荀龙自有双。\n共将船载酒，同泛月临江。\n远树悬金镜，深潭倒玉幢。\n委波添净练，洞照灭凝釭。\n阗咽沙头市，𤫩珑竹岸窗\n巴童唱巫峡，海客话神泷。\n已困连飞盏，犹催未倒缸。\n饮荒情烂熳，风棹乐峥摐。\n胜事他年忆，愁心此夜降。\n知君皆逸韵，须爲应莛撞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21365.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21365","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}